1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:03,789
Imagine a bank that pays one hundred percent interest a year.

2
00:00:03,789 --> 00:00:08,710
Compound it twice a year and you get one point five squared, two point two five.

3
00:00:08,710 --> 00:00:09,869
Monthly, more.

4
00:00:09,869 --> 00:00:11,523
Daily, more still.

5
00:00:11,523 --> 00:00:15,351
Yet however often you compound, it never runs away.

6
00:00:15,351 --> 00:00:17,721
It approaches a fixed number: e.

